---
description: TSDoc only on exports
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TSDoc

Document exported functions, components, hooks, types, and domain rules with a short TSDoc block.

Do not document local variables, obvious parameters, or line-by-line behavior.

When a rule has a known ceiling, name the ceiling and the upgrade in that TSDoc. `dueState` is the example: clock hours now, business calendar later.
